  "display_title": "I'm a Part-Timer for the Gods",
  "description": "When areas called “Dungeons” started appearing, individuals with Abilities also emerged. Dam-Deok Yu believed that these Abilities would catapult mankind to greater heights until he realized he wasn’t given any! Dam-Deok loathed his situation so much that he cursed the gods, and the gods seemed to have heard him since he was struck by lightning. When he woke up, a system window appeared, telling him the gods were waiting for him…\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
